<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg says buy Gilead.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg says buy Gilead.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg Thalmann said analyst Andre Garnet initiated coverage of Gilead Sciences Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/4 to 31-1/8.</p>
